{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And YHWH said to Moses and to Aaron.</b> Because Aaron performed and labored in the signs like Moses, He apportioned him this honor in the first commandment — including him together with Moses in the utterance." "<b>In the land of Egypt.</b> Outside the metropolis. Or is it indeed within the metropolis? Scripture says (above 9:29): ״כְּצֵאתִי אֶת הָעִיר וְגוֹ״ — and if a light prayer he did not pray within the metropolis, a weighty utterance — not all the more so! And why was He not spoken with within the metropolis? Because it was full of idols."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:29.920461712Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}